{"id":12599,"date":"2025-07-28T07:52:20","date_gmt":"2025-07-28T07:52:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12599"},"modified":"2025-07-28T07:52:20","modified_gmt":"2025-07-28T07:52:20","slug":"udrzitelne-produkty-z-plastoveho-odpadu-webinar","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/udrzitelne-produkty-z-plastoveho-odpadu-webinar\/","title":{"rendered":"Udr\u017eiteln\u00e9 produkty z plastov\u00e9ho odpadu: Webin\u00e1\u0159"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"496\">Jak prom\u011bnit plastov\u00fd odpad v nov\u00fd, hodnotn\u00fd materi\u00e1l? A jakou roli p\u0159i tom hraje <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\"><strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"345\">FTIR spektroskopie<\/strong><\/a>? P\u0159ipojte se k\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.azom.com\/webinar.aspx?id=1031&amp;referrer=ThermoEmail&amp;tracksrc=IntEm-Button1-2180400&amp;leadsource=Email&amp;C_Campaign_Element=7014z000001pp9iAAA&amp;elqTrackId=93ecdf06926047568a4e13c55819dc34&amp;elq=fce6ca9b780c47ac98cd00b25129aa2f&amp;elqaid=6527&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqCampaignId=2591&amp;elqak=8AF577897EAF5EC039AE7AFC231AAF17C9BE301D892FC9F3F55CA83FE087B394B027\"><strong data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"391\">5d\u00edln\u00e9 s\u00e9rii webin\u00e1\u0159\u016f<\/strong><\/a>, kde v\u00e1m uk\u00e1\u017eeme, jak propojit v\u011bdu, techniku a udr\u017eitelnost p\u0159i v\u00fdvoji modern\u00edch polymern\u00edch materi\u00e1l\u016f.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"520\"><strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"520\">O \u010dem webin\u00e1\u0159 bude?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"819\">Modern\u00ed plasty \u2013 vyu\u017e\u00edvan\u00e9 v obalech, automobilov\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu \u010di textilu \u2013 jsou \u010dasto chemicky komplexn\u00ed a obt\u00ed\u017en\u011b recyklovateln\u00e9. V t\u00e9to s\u00e9rii v\u00e1m uk\u00e1\u017eeme, <strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"752\">jak efektivn\u011b t\u0159\u00eddit a zpracov\u00e1vat plastov\u00fd odpad<\/strong> a jak p\u0159em\u011bnit recykl\u00e1t na nov\u00e9 produkty pomoc\u00ed \u0161pi\u010dkov\u00fdch metod.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1059\">Zvl\u00e1\u0161tn\u00ed pozornost v\u011bnujeme <strong data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"926\">FTIR spektroskopii (Fourierova transformovan\u00e1 infra\u010derven\u00e1 spektroskopie)<\/strong>: kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 metod\u011b pro <strong data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1016\">rychlou a p\u0159esnou identifikaci polymern\u00edch slo\u017eek i kontaminant\u016f<\/strong> v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase b\u011bhem zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed materi\u00e1lu.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1094\"><strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1094\">Pro koho je s\u00e9rie ur\u010dena?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1289\">Pro <strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1144\">v\u00fdzkumn\u00edky, v\u00fdvoj\u00e1\u0159e a technick\u00e9 experty<\/strong> z pr\u016fmyslu i akademick\u00e9 sf\u00e9ry, kte\u0159\u00ed pracuj\u00ed s polymery, biopolymery a hledaj\u00ed zp\u016fsoby, jak integrovat recyklovan\u00e9 materi\u00e1ly do nov\u00fdch produkt\u016f.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1314\"><strong data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1314\">Co si odnesete?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1507\"><strong data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1348\">FTIR spektroskopie v praxi<\/strong>: Nau\u010d\u00edte se, jak vyu\u017e\u00edt FTIR jako n\u00e1stroj pro <strong data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1422\">inline kontrolu kvality<\/strong> p\u0159i recyklaci plast\u016f a jak interpretovat spektra v kontextu v\u00fdvoje nov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1630\"><strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1532\">Inovativn\u00ed procesy<\/strong>: Zjist\u00edte, jak mal\u00e9 extruzn\u00ed jednotky a reologie podporuj\u00ed rychl\u00e9 testov\u00e1n\u00ed a optimalizaci sm\u011bs\u00ed.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1740\"><strong data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1653\">Regulace a normy<\/strong>: Z\u00edsk\u00e1te p\u0159ehled o sou\u010dasn\u00fdch po\u017eadavc\u00edch na recyklovan\u00e9 plasty a jak s nimi pracovat.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1815\"><strong data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1766\">Prostor pro diskuzi<\/strong>: V ka\u017ed\u00e9m d\u00edle v\u00e1s \u010dek\u00e1 Q&amp;A s odborn\u00edky z praxe.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1850\"><strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1850\">Pro\u010d byste nem\u011bli chyb\u011bt?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"2084\">FTIR spektroskopie dnes p\u0159edstavuje <strong data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1907\">z\u00e1sadn\u00ed n\u00e1stroj<\/strong> pro efektivn\u00ed a udr\u017eiteln\u00fd v\u00fdvoj plastov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f. Pokud chcete b\u00fdt na \u0161pici technologick\u00e9ho pokroku a z\u00e1rove\u0148 p\u0159isp\u011bt k cirkul\u00e1rn\u00ed ekonomice, tato s\u00e9rie je p\u0159esn\u011b pro v\u00e1s. Webin\u00e1\u0159 je ke shl\u00e9dnut\u00ed na vy\u017e\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed, nem\u00e1 stanoven\u00fd term\u00edn a pod\u00edvat se na n\u011bj <a href=\"https:\/\/www.azom.com\/webinar.aspx?id=1031&amp;referrer=ThermoEmail&amp;tracksrc=IntEm-Button1-2180400&amp;leadsource=Email&amp;C_Campaign_Element=7014z000001pp9iAAA&amp;elqTrackId=93ecdf06926047568a4e13c55819dc34&amp;elq=fce6ca9b780c47ac98cd00b25129aa2f&amp;elqaid=6527&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqCampaignId=2591&amp;elqak=8AF577897EAF5EC039AE7AFC231AAF17C9BE301D892FC9F3F55CA83FE087B394B027\"><strong>m\u016f\u017eete zde<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Jak prom\u011bnit plastov\u00fd odpad v nov\u00fd, hodnotn\u00fd materi\u00e1l? A jakou roli p\u0159i tom hraje FTIR spektroskopie? P\u0159ipojte se k\u00a05d\u00edln\u00e9 s\u00e9rii webin\u00e1\u0159\u016f, kde v\u00e1m uk\u00e1\u017eeme, jak propojit v\u011bdu, techniku a udr\u017eitelnost p\u0159i v\u00fdvoji modern\u00ed